{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Demo version of Echoes of Myth features the full core gameplay loop through the first zone\u201414 stages across three biomes with randomized area selection, rewards, and enemy setups. Story content is limited to the tutorial and introductory NPC dialogue; narrative progression and quests are not included. Planned to be available for a limited time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Echoes of Myth is a roguelite action RPG set in a shattered fantasy world where gods have vanished. Carve through enemies in Hades-meets-Souls combat, seize divine relics, and grow stronger with each death.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4047000/extras/2fbd0e098a3a0ca77112b8f02f64b875.poster.avif?t=1758990744\" width=600 height=202 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4047000/extras/2fbd0e098a3a0ca77112b8f02f64b875.webm?t=1758990744\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4047000/extras/2fbd0e098a3a0ca77112b8f02f64b875.mp4?t=1758990744\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Hades-meets-Souls Combat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wield both steel and sorcery:\u00a0Start every new run by choosing from three unique weapon\u2013spell combos, sometimes already infused with a modifier. As you progress, unlock more spells and adapt your style\u2014go all-in on melee, lean into spellcasting, or weave the two together for devastating synergy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4047000/extras/41b38fa1c2b0153fc27f1d47a32e18bd.poster.avif?t=1758990744\" width=560 height=194 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4047000/extras/41b38fa1c2b0153fc27f1d47a32e18bd.webm?t=1758990744\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4047000/extras/41b38fa1c2b0153fc27f1d47a32e18bd.mp4?t=1758990744\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore a Fragmented Fantasy World</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate through an ever-shifting map of fractured paths. Each node grants a distinct reward, and you can glimpse part of what lies ahead to plan your route and weigh tradeoffs. Along the way, uncover fragments of the world\u2019s mystery and meet NPCs whose stories entwine with your own.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4047000/extras/d90312c9d40e254ea8be5d2d91fa4590.poster.avif?t=1758990744\" width=600 height=162 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4047000/extras/d90312c9d40e254ea8be5d2d91fa4590.webm?t=1758990744\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4047000/extras/d90312c9d40e254ea8be5d2d91fa4590.mp4?t=1758990744\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build for the Run, Power for Eternity</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shape each of your runs with relics, talents, and spell\u2013weapon combos, upgrading and infuse-modifying them as you go. Even when you fall, essence carries forward\u2014fueling permanent upgrades that make future builds deadlier and let you chase the playstyles you love.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4047000/extras/55d97bf35418b4be5e8dc742ed6ae14a.poster.avif?t=1758990744\" width=600 height=160 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4047000/extras/55d97bf35418b4be5e8dc742ed6ae14a.webm?t=1758990744\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4047000/extras/55d97bf35418b4be5e8dc742ed6ae14a.mp4?t=1758990744\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hades-meets-Souls Combat</strong>: Mix weighty melee strikes, impactful spells, and precise dodges against challenging enemies and bosses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Weapon\u2013Spell Choices</strong>: Start every run by picking from three randomized weapon\u2013spell combos, sometimes already infused with modifiers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build Crafting</strong>: Shape each run with relics, talents, spells, and infusions, then upgrade them mid-run for growing power.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Permanent Progression</strong>: Collect mythic essence during runs and spend it at the hub to permanently strengthen your soul.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Branching Paths</strong>: Navigate an ever-shifting node-based map where each path offers distinct rewards and tradeoffs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Relics of the Gods</strong>: Seize divine relics left behind by vanished gods, each with combat-defining power.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4047000?t=1758990744","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4047000?t=1758990744","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4047000/8277a5b1f81397f0646db99f74b4c2fffbbe8820/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758990744","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steam