 Seize divine relics left behind by vanished gods, each with combat-defining power.</p></li></ul>","developers":["Shifting Reality Interactive"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3383100","name":"Echoes of Myth"},"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4047000/d7d295a076152085c6b3763150e2bea90b9c771e/header.jpg?t=1758990744","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4047000/143930126/bfe19578b443308ebb7cfe914d062e04861ca6d5/1758704501/dash_av1.mpd?t=1758990742","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4047000/143930126/bfe19578b443308ebb7cfe914d062e04861ca6d5/1758704501/dash_h264.mpd?t=1758990742","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4047000/143930126/bfe19578b443308ebb7cfe914d062e04861ca6d5/1758704501/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1758990742","id":257205303,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257205303/movie480.mp4?t=1758990742","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257205303/movie_max.mp4?t=1758990742"},"name":"Echoes of Myth Demo Release Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257205303/ce749390aafc4956c25f10f6dc0e256fa1eaed24/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1758990742","webm":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257205303/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1758990742","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257205303/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1758990742"}}],"name":"Echoes of Myth Demo","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements"